 ```
 VERDICT: PASS | PASS-with-notes | FAIL
 Delta: <bead> <mb-short>..<tip-short> (<n> files, +a/-d)   branch fleet/<x>
-Gate: fleet-check <state> for <sha> (cached, run by <lane> <at>)   [or UNKNOWN: <why>]
